## Third-party components

### doomgeneric

The game engine is [doomgeneric](https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric) by
Ozan Kılıç, based on the DOOM source release by id Software.

- License: GPL-2.0-or-later
- The WASM build in `vendor/engine/doom.{js,wasm}` is downloaded by
  `scripts/fetch-assets.mjs` from the `@muhammedaksam/opentui-doom` npm package
  (MIT-licensed wrapper, see below). It is not committed to this repository.

### @muhammedaksam/opentui-doom

The prebuilt doomgeneric WASM module and the extracted DOOM sound assets are
taken from <https://github.com/muhammedaksam/opentui-doom> (MIT). Used as an
asset source only; none of its runtime code is imported by this plugin.

### DOOM shareware data

`vendor/doom1.wad` and the files in `vendor/sound/` are data from the DOOM
shareware release, (c) id Software. They are downloaded on demand and are not
committed to this repository. DOOM shareware permits free redistribution; the
registered game data does not, and this project does not ship or download it.

### OpenTUI / OpenCode

The plugin targets the OpenTUI renderer and plugin API bundled with OpenCode.
Those packages keep their own licenses (MIT).
